{
  "id": "GEN.43",
  "number": "43",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Giing'Eeta 43",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "43",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 43"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "43",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Orjooga geenyea Yosefu gabiikta Misri nea goodeayi Benjamini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda nea ning'waaniit geejeeda aba jeeda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea niyaak booga ghayi eana ng'eanyiida Misri, ghwalamda ghwaan ak gwayeesha orjoagaaschi, “Abiikta gicha ak goosheayneasa boosu ng'ay.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Yuda niny, “Siida ghamiin gheang'deanya nea gwayi, ‘Mwajadaaha gheanyangeasu, ea eaghus andeawana orjeeda geamadu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iijea nung' eeteayeewana orjeeda giyeanya, abeeda gajeeweaya ak geesheayneey booga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ama maynung' eeteayeewana, ea majeeweaya, aba gideaba gwayeeshiineasa siida, ‘Mwajadaahaan ea eaghus andeawana orjeeda giyeang'wa.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Israeli ak gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan anda googoonyean sawanadeeda aba gideaba gooyeeshi siida geendeawi orjeediyya nuut?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha saawa nea gwayeesha, “Siida ghoanyaashtaneasa muuchi aseasa sea buweadeagaasa nea gwayi, ‘Ghweandeang'wa gudugwanda? Agooga goondeawi orjeeda giyeang'wa nuudi?’ Ak ng'asheega sirukusi geashaahi ng'asheesu anyaashtaan; nea aseasa geanali gideaba gaygwayi, ‘Ayeani orjeeda giyeang'wa’?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Yuda ghwaan was Israeli, “Goona orjeeda deadeayi aniini, ak gajeeng'eatng'eada eeweaya, ak abeeda geaghuyi ea meemeewi, eesa sean aseasa ea ang'iing'i ea diibigaasa manang'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydaghashta eaweegeasu aba badaydaanyi; ak gaygasa orjeeda aba geatingeasu. Iimeadeelni headaang'u ak ghaayiinyi madeadaang'u, abeeda ginung' dasar munyinda damanda manda muudeanooda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba inyeeda ea mii sishing'di, gwachi gajea sibiikti nibiyeenya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda ghweanda nyaawa was Israeli ak gwayeesha saawa, “Ng'asheanji iijea gwasunu, abeeda goosindunu: ageani haghweega miyaasiin bea ng'eanyiida ak ghoayiinyi jeesinga mushoodakeagwa, ak gooyeasi siidida ghoah haleanjeeda guskuseega, nagheeni mwanang' ea maleeni mwanang' ea mughoondooda ea geediga ng'andit, ea geediga ng'andidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayaadana geadi lapiyeeda deayeat; oakghuumda lapiyeeda biigu aba ghuusiga mushoodakeagwa; aba gideaba gwadeepa gwaroosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayaada eara orjeeda geamadu, ak ghoalamwajaadi aweayeena heeda siida; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gagasa ghwanung' ASEETA haw ghabwaydaneegwa siida, ak gagooneegwa orjeeda giyeang'wa niirja sea Benjamini. Ama jea gwarooda diibigeasu, gaygwarooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaat orjooga haleanjeeda guskuseega, ak ghwaat lapiyeeda deayeat, sea Benjamini; ak ghang'eatng'eat gaweay ng'eanyiida Misri, ea ghwahita madeeda Yosefu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah Yosefu Benjamini sea saawa, gwayeesha siida haweewa fuga gadiyeedeaba gheanyi, “Eani fiisu jeedeaba gheenyu, ak ginuusi mbooyda ak ghoawaali hamita, aba gideaba fiisu gaydeambuuchi askweari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasinda siida ng'asheega gidarukusiinda Yosefu ak ghwaat buuneeda gheeh Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean siyaat buuneeda jeeda gheeh Yosefu ghabeal nea gwayi, “Nih gwadeepa ea ng'asheega lapiyeeda siyiin jeesinga mushoodakaasa damanda ghayi bea madeeda, ak ghoah gisiyeaseasa jeeda gheeda, ak abeeda gang'adeeseasa ak ghabwareasa, ak ghwanung' eahuuwa giing'oonyanga ak ghoang'waay digeenigaasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaweay heeda siida haweewa gadiyeeda aba gheeh Yosefu, ak goobalool aba gidaghuuta gheeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayeesha, “Ea ng'utamiideanya, ghayi sipkaanyi eaweeda madeeda eashaaha booga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iidu nea geehidu heeda jea eelana geetineadi mushoodakaasa, ak gwanda ghuutpa giliwas mushootpa sih lapiya, lapiyeedeanya sean; ak ghamneawa geapkaanyi nea geeyeadu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geeyeani geatingaasa lapiya suuk jea eashaahana booga. Ak ea meanali siida iin lapiya jeesinga mushoodakaasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha nea gwayeesha, “Adoabeali, adaghang'udeagwa muuwda; gwadeepa ghwayiin ASEETEANG'WA ea ASEETA ghweandeang'wa ghwayiin lapiya jeesinga mushoodakeagwa, lapiyeedeang'wa naanyaschi.” Ak gooruudu Simeoni jarooda heanyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwaat siida gadiyeeda buuneeda jeeda gheeh Yosefu, ak ghoadaw beega, ak goohuun geeshanga nyaawa, ak ghoadaw digeeniga nyaawa nyeega, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gageanu haleanjeeda guskuseega jea ghoadaw Yosefu iihidu nea ghwadarasha aseeta, aba gideaba sirukusa gideaba gaygoombuuchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahidu Yosefu ghoah, gageanu haleanjeeda guskuseega ak ghwaat jeeda gheeda headaanyi ak gwatkuy ea ghwahita ng'eanyi aba madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoanyaash ea gaba seayu, ak gwayeesha, “Ghweandeang'wa waas oorukunean iita gaba seayu? Gudeamajeegi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha saawa, “Siidaang'u was soomjeanda was ghweandeanya gaba seayu, ak ea gudeamajeek.” Ak gabuy iheenga nyaawa nea gwatkuy aba madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gagatkat gheanyangaaschi, ak ghwadaah orjeeda ghaamwat was Benjamini, ak gwayeesha, “Nih orjeeda giyeang'wa mwanang' oorukuneani? Gagasa gagoonyi ASEETA ghawooda, orjeedeanyu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamwach geaw Yosefu, aba gideaba gwasawana jeadaanyi aba orjeeda ghaamwat, ea gagasa gooyeawda. Ak gawa jeeda ghooriida heeda manda sih ak gooyeawda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goohuun gheanyangaaschi ak gwardu jarooda; hean ghoahang'waay geaw ak gwayeesha, “Ayeani gichea eayaak.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geang'aata niny aba hichpa geaw, ak geang'aata saawa aba hichpa geat, nea fuga Misri ambuuchi sea niny gweagiischi aba hichpa geat, aba gideaba fuga Misri maygoombuuchi mukaate sea fuga Ebraniya, aba gideaba eamuy aba heeda fuga Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goobiitpiit aba madeadaanyi, nea gwajipta geat gidaghayi buwaanda gweanyeeka nyaawa ghang'eada duweacheeda ea gagul dea mwanang'eawa sean; ak gang'ula geat nea ghahamng'eanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
